{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794339933773,"sessionID":"ses_e390f5dcfffeIMyrnhIN59SkWV","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call_1bbe424cf00c41d8bc95a58d","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/README.md","newString":"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions (with hashes) and is what gets installed. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).","oldString":"Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it)."},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/README.md\n+++ /workspace/README.md\n@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@\n \n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions (with hashes) and is what gets installed. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/README.md","patch":"Index: /workspace/README.md\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/README.md\n+++ /workspace/README.md\n@@ -11,5 +11,5 @@\n \n - `backend/`: the Flask app (`backend/app.py`, served by gunicorn as `app:app`); dependencies in `backend/requirements.txt`.\n - `frontend/`: a Vite project (React + TypeScript). `npm run build` writes `frontend/dist`, which the image copies next to the backend.\n \n-Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions and is installed as a pip constraints file. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n+Dependencies are pinned: `backend/requirements.lock` holds the resolved versions (with hashes) and is what gets installed. The frontend uses `frontend/package-lock.json` (`npm ci`). When you change dependencies, update the lock file as well (or remove it).\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"README.md","time":{"start":1794339933762,"end":1794339933771}},"id":"prt_1c6fe8e3e001blLgX9LF7yTnXT","sessionID":"ses_e390f5dcfffeIMyrnhIN59SkWV","messageID":"msg_1c6fe728a001cn2NZc2IxgGQR1"}}
